Pelosi said she said Kavanaugh’s testimony showed he was unfit to serve on the Supreme Court, since he showed he was against the Democrats.
“I think he’s discrediting himself with these statements and the way he’s attacked the Clintons and Democrats,” she said.
Pelosi hesitated when asked if she would try to impeach Kavanaugh if it was confirmed, and if the Democrats got a majority in the House of Representatives.
“If he doesn’t tell the truth in Congress or the FBI, he’s not only unfit to sit on the Supreme Court, but he’s also unfit to sit in the court where he’s currently,” Pelosi said.
Kavanaugh is currently a judge of the DC Circuit Court of Appeal.
